	<name>PasDoc GUI</name>
	<summary>Documentation generator for Object Pascal source code</summary>
	<description>
		<p>
			PasDoc is a documentation tool for Pascal and Object Pascal source code.
			Documentation is generated from comments found in the source code or from external files.
			Multiple output formats are supported, including HTML and LaTeX.		
		</p>
	</description>
